Package: protondrive
Title: An Interface to Proton Drive
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Travis", "Hinkelman", , "thinkelman@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Manage files on Proton Drive from R. Functions mirror the
    'googledrive' package: list, find, upload, download, copy, move, rename,
    trash, and share files and folders. All end-to-end encryption, session
    handling, and API traffic are delegated to the official Proton Drive
    command-line interface, which is built on the Proton Drive SDK
    <https://github.com/ProtonDriveApps/sdk>. This is a third-party package
    that is not officially supported by Proton.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/hinkelman/protondrive
BugReports: https://github.com/hinkelman/protondrive/issues
